["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/packageUrl", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Package-URL (PURL), as defined in [ECMA-427](https://ecma-international.org/publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-427/).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
